  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:178px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Unipsycho.jpg\" title=\"Shadow Psycho Champion\"><img alt=\"Shadow Psycho Champion\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"131\" src=\"/images/Unipsycho.jpg\" width=\"176\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Unipsycho.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Psycho Champion</div></div></div>\n<p>Small mutant monsters that runs with their two blade-wheels, which they also use to attack.  They usually come in groups accompanied by larger Mobs of various types.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>These little guys like to surround you. They can do a lot of damage this way.  Try to take them out with an AoE spell early.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Mutant Unipsycho\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> level 5 - 7, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Mutant Unipsycho\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Mutant Unipsycho\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>, level 1 - 4, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Mutant Unipsycho\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
